# --- Data ---
# The raw CSVs ARE committed: they are deterministic, synthetic and small
# enough that a reviewer can reproduce the analysis without running the
# generator first. Uncomment the next line to prefer regenerating them.
# data/raw/*.csv

# --- Reports ---
# Figures and rendered reports are committed for reviewer convenience.
# Uncomment the next two lines if you prefer to keep the repository light.
# reports/figures/*.png
# reports/sql_results.md

